"if allowed by the Qubes OS RPC policy. Programming errors in the Admin API "
"however may cause these access rights to be more permissive than anticipated "
"by the programmer. If the there is a client error and the API response is "
"too restrictive, it won't reveal any information making it difficult to "
"debug and handle errors, as it is a general error. More details:"
